          "title": "Cetatea Suceava - CSM Slatina 2-0",
          "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPR1pmd3U4anl3OHY0Si1MMVVBdE1xNmQxZmlmcHRhUWJoZzU5cWVVRURyYlh5dTVFeEZFYUVIUURTVDdVNlZCcUdMX1NSRXR6UjdKXzItaFBHb1dQOGQ3YzJVZEdpMnZJc3lNdTRzaHNyekJ4RGlramtXR3hhbmU0M1Vwd29kamdOR3FSajNhcEZnUQ?oc=5",
